.DS_Store
# config.toml is not local tooling here: it carries the linker flags and the
# picotool runner both Pico targets need, so it has to be tracked.
.cargo/*
!.cargo/config.toml
.claude/
.idea/
# Cargo.lock is deliberately *not* ignored. This is a binary, not a library, so
# the lockfile is what makes a checkout on another machine resolve the same
# dependency set that was actually built and tested here -- which matters more
# than usual with two HALs and a linker in the graph, where a semver-compatible
# bump can turn into a link error rather than a compile error.
flamegraph.svg
src/.DS_Store

# Commercial cartridge dumps. Supply your own -- see README.md.
#
# One level only, so the freely redistributable blargg suite under
# test-roms/gb-test-roms-master/ stays tracked; that is what the test suite
# actually needs.
test-roms/*.gb
test-roms/*.gbc